# TORGIMA UI Immutability (Layer 1 frozen)

Approved dashboard designs are **production UI**. Build backend, APIs, sync, calculations, automation, and Bhudhi behavior in **Layer 2** only.

## Never change (refuse if asked)

Layout, structure, styling, visual hierarchy, header controls, card size/position/spacing, section order, typography, theme/brand colors, chart/table/list **shell** design.

If asked to improve/redesign/modernize/simplify/restructure UI, respond:

> TORGIMA UI is locked. Only functionality, intelligence, synchronization, calculations, automation, and data updates are allowed.

## Allowed changes only

Dynamic text, metrics, chart **values/labels/dates** (not position/size/style), table **rows**, list **items**, message content, validation/signal/condition outputs.

## Development workflow

1. Find existing component — do not create a replacement shell.
2. Inject data/logic into it.
3. Preserve design exactly.
4. Verify no visual diff beyond data binding.

## Screen shells (data only)

| Screen | Locked regions |
|--------|----------------|
| Home | Blueprint progress, orders, signal overview, activity, timeline, milestones |
| Bhudhi | Core panel, explanations, questions, system activity, info sources |
| Erector | Validation/simulator/industry/learning cards, recent lists |
| Validation results | Reality score, verdict, competitors, risks, opportunities, success plan |
| Signals | Graph, condition, competitors, milestones, Bhudhi panel |
| Project | Signal trend, condition, health, milestones, competitors |
| Community / Academy / Messages / Settings | All layout; settings = user fields only |

**Navigation:** fixed 10-item sidebar after Launch Direction only — see `docs/TORGIMA_NAVIGATION_AND_ACTIVATION.md`.

Full policy: `docs/TORGIMA_UI_IMMUTABILITY.md`
